oked graceful, obedient, above all, beautiful. Soon he contracted with her, and she paid homage to him. However, she was a problematic Inukami that no one had been able to control.\n\nThis is a slap stick comedy of an Inukami Tamer, Keita and an Inukami, Youko. Keita is a man of worldly passions, and he likes money and girls very much. On the other hand, Youko likes to destroy things and is very jealous.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Youkai","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Inukami!","english":"Inukami!","native":"いぬかみっ!","romaji":"Inukami!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"犬神"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}